Section: Development
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: build-essential, clang, ldid
Recommends: rust-std-1.98, cargo-1.98
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://www.rust-lang.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Rust systems programming language compiler
 Cross-built on a Mac because the rustc bootstrap builds LLVM, which does not
 fit on this device. The compiler itself runs on the device: it compiles, links
 and signs programs without any help from a desktop.
 .
 The linker signs every executable and dylib it produces with ldid, using the
 entitlements plist inside the toolchain, because jailbroken iOS kills unsigned
 images and refuses to dlopen them.
